# Testing Checklist

After making changes to the game, remind the user to test the following. List only the items relevant to what was changed.

## Scene Transitions
- Scene loads without console errors
- Fade-in/fade-out plays correctly
- Clicking the navigation arrow (or walking to the edge) advances to the correct next scene
- If a `nextScene` was changed, verify the full flow from the modified scene onward

## Dialogue
- All dialogue lines display with the correct speaker name
- Clicking advances through each line in order
- Skip button appears when 3+ consecutive dialogue lines remain
- Close-up dialogue shows and hides properly

## Interactions
- All `waitForClick` targets are clickable (not hidden, not missing `interactive: true`)
- Hover glow appears on the correct target
- Objects show/hide at the right moments in the sequence

## Letter Collection
- Letters appear in the full-screen viewer when collected
- Collected letters persist and are accessible via the envelope HUD icon
- Letter navigation (prev/next arrows) works in the viewer

## Save / Load
- Saving captures the current scene and sequence step
- Loading resumes at the correct scene and step (fast-forward restores object/character visibility)
- All 3 save slots work independently

## Music
- Music fades in at the correct moment (after Erma dialogue in Scene 3)
- Volume slider in pause menu adjusts playback volume in real time
- Music loops continuously across scene transitions
- Music stops on quit-to-menu and reset

## Branching (Scene 22)
- All 5 dialogue option prompts appear with 3 choices each
- Follow-up dialogue displays after each choice
- The correct ending scene loads based on majority category
